--- text
Your [PRODUCT_NAME] account is still here

You have not signed in to [PRODUCT_NAME] since [LAST_ACTIVE_DATE].
The account is still here, and everything you put in it is still
there. This email sets out where things stand, so you can decide
what to do with it.

What has changed in [PRODUCT_NAME] since then:

- [ITEM_1_TITLE]. [ITEM_1_SUMMARY]
- [ITEM_2_TITLE]. [ITEM_2_SUMMARY]
- [ITEM_3_TITLE]. [ITEM_3_SUMMARY]

Sign in to your account:

[CTA_URL]

If you do nothing, nothing happens today. An account that is not
used is kept for [RETENTION_PERIOD] after the last sign-in. For this
account that is [RETENTION_END_DATE]. Until then the account and
everything in it stay as they are.

After that the account and its data are deleted, and cannot be
recovered. Signing in before then keeps the account, and starts
that period again.

If you would rather not keep the account, you can close your
account yourself and delete its data now. You do not have to tell
us why.

Close your account:

[SECONDARY_URL]

Unsubscribe at the bottom of this email to stop messages like this
one. Unsubscribing stops the emails only. It does not close the
account, and it does not delete anything.

Questions about the account, or about what happens to your data?
Reply to this email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person
reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
